{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quirky mushrooms, greedy lumberjacks, endless battles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, evolve, and supercharge your fungal defenders to keep the forest alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/eac64a91c6fc7b91b4e099414a618ae5.poster.avif?t=1764679349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/eac64a91c6fc7b91b4e099414a618ae5.webm?t=1764679349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/eac64a91c6fc7b91b4e099414a618ae5.mp4?t=1764679349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why it\u2019s spore-tacular:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 <strong>No cookie-cutter maps!</strong> Every island is procedurally generated with rivers, forests, and choke points that force you to rethink your strategy every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 <strong>Nature fights dirty!</strong> Poisonous Shrooms, exploding Shrooms, natural-disaster-summoning Shrooms \u2014 each species has unique powers and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 <strong>No lanes, no rails!</strong> Lumberjacks wander freely, carving their own roads and bridges as they go. Defend from every angle \u2014 not just a straight line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 <strong>Axe-wielding weirdos!</strong> Speedy sprinters, flamethrower fanatics, jetpack junkies, and massive boss jacks \u2014 every enemy brings a new headache.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 <strong>Grow stronger every run!\u00a0</strong>Each failed invasion feeds the forest. Unlock new Shrooms, discover new biomes, and activate powerful modifiers that twist each run into something new. Your tiny fungi get stronger every time you try\u2026 even if the trees don\u2019t survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 <strong>Bend the battle your way!</strong> Unleash player-controlled abilities, apply game-changing modifiers, and complete skill-testing challenges that shake up every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/dd68d50019e4a030446cc13d15e66ad1.poster.avif?t=1764679349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/dd68d50019e4a030446cc13d15e66ad1.webm?t=1764679349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/dd68d50019e4a030446cc13d15e66ad1.mp4?t=1764679349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Jacks keep coming, you keep Shrooming</strong> \ud83c\udf32</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two invasions are the same. Each run brings new islands, new enemy paths, and new decisions \u2014 where to build, what to sacrifice, and how to make those lumberjacks deeply regret picking up an axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/3b283249515e46ee5d145ac211447767.poster.avif?t=1764679349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/3b283249515e46ee5d145ac211447767.webm?t=1764679349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/3b283249515e46ee5d145ac211447767.mp4?t=1764679349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude93 <strong>Lumberjacks never learn</strong> \ud83e\ude93</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave after wave, they\u2019ll burn, chop, and bulldoze everything in sight. You won\u2019t save every tree\u2026 but you <i>can</i> make sure every jack pays for every splinter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/085465ab96a473b266d96736bb191d00.poster.avif?t=1764679349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/085465ab96a473b266d96736bb191d00.webm?t=1764679349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/085465ab96a473b266d96736bb191d00.mp4?t=1764679349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shrooms 1 : Lumberjacks 0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310170/9c0777ac649bfc95ed4bce06a6fb135de5406bee.jpg"},{"name":"Man Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310170/d12ecc11e389805398cd3515a22477802c874cef.jpg"},{"name":"Maxed Out Mush","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310170/d320e0b7cced5807690ff524c6f7090a0bd2ac2a.jpg"},{"name":"Spore Squad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310170/da15fd5a7cb6f3b4c0df3edfe56d5d034f989fb3.jpg"},{"name":"Manual Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310170/bb84358cef25f646f98275cae2def479561a0cf2.jpg"},{"name":"More Fun Fungi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st